{
 "name": "Test room 10 — echo and rope",
 "notes": "Light Echo and Light Rope, both at level 3. ECHO (X for Blue, ; for Pink): leaves a translucent copy of you where you stand; it holds a pressure plate for 20 seconds. Stand on the plate, cast, and go through the door with your partner. ROPE (C for Blue, the apostrophe key for Pink): press the key, then CLICK a spot in either view; the rope shoots out of your hand and catches the first thing it meets (up to 16 tiles). On a surface (aim at the ceiling): swing from it like a pendulum — left/right pump it, crouch reels it in, jump lets go and keeps your speed. On a loose key: crouch reels it to you. On your partner: crouch reels them in to you, flying across the gap. COURSE: (1) an echo holds the plate while you both pass; (2) a 12-wide pit: shoot the rope at the ceiling over its middle, step off the edge, swing across and let go on the far side; (3) the key on the island: rope it and reel it in, then take it to the door; (4) another pit: one of you swings across, then pulls the other over.",
 "hint": "Echo (X / semicolon): a copy that holds the plate. Rope (C / apostrophe): press, then click the ceiling to swing, a key to fetch it, or your partner to pull them over. Crouch reels in; jump lets go.",
